# Speedball, New Warrior: "Whenever a player casts a spell that targets Speedball, he gets +2/+2 until end of turn. You may
# choose new targets for that spell." Bot2's first Lightning Bolt goes at Bot1's face: no trigger. The second targets
# Speedball: he is a 4/4 and Bot1 keeps the target (3 damage, he lives). The third targets him too: 6/6, and Bot1 sends
# that Bolt at Bot2 instead, so he is not dealt 3 more (6 damage in all would not kill a 6/6, but 3 + 3 + 3 would kill a 4/4).

